    <briefdescription>
<para>Habitat domain implementation for branch nodes in a spatial tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class manages habitat domain information for a branch terrain cell. It can aggregate habitat data from its children and apply a combined habitat domain status to the branch node. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
